---@field scaleTargetRef kubernetes.autoscaling.IoK8sApiAutoscalingV1CrossVersionObjectReference scaleTargetRef is the reference to scaled resource; horizontal pod autoscaler will learn the current resource consumption and will set the desired number of pods by using its Scale subresource.
